{"sha": "48ed59fcff18386880666d7dafdbd369863c94f66ffed4b8d7f6615017dc9a2e", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.8cm, height=5cm,", "  xmin=-0.4, xmax=4.4, ymin=0, ymax=1.15,", "  xtick={1.3}, xticklabels={$t$}, ytick={1}, yticklabels={$\\lambda$}]", "  \\addplot[name path=dens, omDef, thick, domain=0:4.2, samples=80]", "    {exp(-x)};", "  \\path[name path=xaxis] (0,0) -- (4.2,0);", "  \\addplot[omThm!20] fill between[of=dens and xaxis,", "    soft clip={domain=1.3:4.2}];", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:1.3,0) -- (axis cs:1.3,0.2725);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:2.1,0.35)", "    {$\\P(X > t) = \\eu^{-\\lambda t}$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 指数密度 $\\lambda\\eu^{-\\lambda x}$（此处", "$\\lambda = 1$）：超过 $t$ 的尾部面积（红色）为 $\\eu^{-\\lambda t}$，", "而无记忆性表明：每段尾部都像整个分布", "经重新缩放后的样子。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{正态分布}", "", "\\begin{definition}[正态分布]\\label{def:g12:contdist:normal}", "设 $X$ 服从\\emph{标准正态分布}\\index{标准正态", "分布} $\\mathcal N(0, 1)$，若其在 $\\R$ 上的密度为", "\\[", "\\varphi(t) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\,\\eu^{-t^2/2}", "\\]", "（钟形曲线）。一般地，", "$X \\sim \\mathcal N(\\mu, \\sigma^2)$，若 $\\dfrac{X - \\mu}{\\sigma} \\sim", "\\mathcal N(0,1)$，则 $\\E(X) = \\mu$，$\\V(X) = \\sigma^2$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[", "  width=11cm, height=4.6cm,", "  axis lines=middle, xmin=-4, xmax=4, ymin=0, ymax=0.45,", "  xtick={-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3},", "  xticklabels={$\\mu{-}3\\sigma$,$\\mu{-}2\\sigma$,$\\mu{-}\\sigma$,$\\mu$,", "               $\\mu{+}\\sigma$,$\\mu{+}2\\sigma$,$\\mu{+}3\\sigma$},", "  ytick=\\empty, samples=120, domain=-4:4]", "  \\addplot[name path=gauss, omDef, thick] {exp(-x^2/2)/sqrt(2*pi)};", "  \\path[name path=xaxis] (-4,0) -- (4,0);", "  \\addplot[omDef!20] fill between[of=gauss and xaxis,", "           soft clip={domain=-2:2}];", "  \\node[omDef] at (axis cs:0,0.17) {$\\approx 95.4\\%$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 正态密度：约 $68.3\\%$ 的概率质量位于", "距均值 $\\sigma$ 之内，$95.4\\%$ 位于 $2\\sigma$ 之内，$99.7\\%$ 位于", "$3\\sigma$ 之内。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "因子 $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}$ 使总面积为 $1$ --- 这是一个著名的", "计算（\\emph{高斯积分}），在大学中完成。", "$\\int \\varphi$ 没有初等的原函数表达式：正态概率需", "查表或借助计算器求得。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[棣莫弗–拉普拉斯定理，在本阶段不加证明地承认]\\label{thm:g12:contdist:tcl}", "\\index{棣莫弗–拉普拉斯定理}", "设 $X_n \\sim \\mathcal B(n, p)$，且", "$Z_n = \\dfrac{X_n - np}{\\sqrt{np(1-p)}}$（标准化二项变量）。则", "对所有 $a \\leq b$，", "\\[", "\\P(a \\leq Z_n \\leq b) \\xrightarrow[n\\to+\\infty]{}", "\\int_a^b \\varphi(t)\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "\\emph{本结论在本阶段不加证明地承认。}它解释了钟形曲线", "为何普遍出现：当 $n$ 很大时，二项分布近似", "服从正态分布 --- 而（中心极限定理，属于大学内容）指出，大量微小的", "独立效应之和同样近似服从正态分布。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{method}[$95\\%$ 水平下的波动区间]\\label{met:g12:contdist:fluctuation}", "\\index{置信区间}", "由于正态变量落在其均值 $1.96$ 个标准差之内的", "概率为 $0.95$，故当 $n$ 很大时，", "频率 $F_n = \\frac{X_n}{n}$（$\\mathcal B(n,p)$ 样本）满足", "\\[", "\\P\\left(p - 1.96\\sqrt{\\tfrac{p(1-p)}{n}} \\leq F_n \\leq", "p + 1.96\\sqrt{\\tfrac{p(1-p)}{n}}\\right) \\approx 0.95 .", "\\]", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{波动区间}（检验）：若假定的 $p$ 使观测频率", "        落在该区间之外，则在", "        $5\\%$ 水平下拒绝该假设。", "  \\item \\emph{置信区间}（估计）：简化的区间", "        $\\left[F_n - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt n},\\ F_n + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt n}\\right]$", "        包含 $p$ 的概率至少为 $0.95$，", "        （利用 $1.96\\sqrt{p(1-p)} \\leq 1$，见\\cref{exo:g12:sums:8}）。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g12:contdist:poll}", "一项对 $n = 1000$ 名选民的民意调查显示，某候选人的得票率为 $52\\%$。", "其置信区间 $52\\% \\pm \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1000}} \\approx 52\\% \\pm 3.2\\%$ 仍", "包含 $50\\%$，因此仅凭这一民调，尚不能断定该候选人", "处于领先地位。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:contdist:1}", "一辆公交车每隔 $15$ 分钟经过一次站点；一名旅客在", "均匀随机的时刻到达。设 $X \\sim \\mathcal U\\intcc{0}{15}$ 为等待时间，", "求 $\\P(X \\leq 5)$，$\\P(4 \\leq X \\leq 10)$，$\\E(X)$ 及 $\\sigma(X)$。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}